<title>FRANCE: France's CDR says sells Innolion unit.</title>
<headline>France's CDR says sells Innolion unit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's state-owned holding Consortium de Realisation (CDR) said on Monday it sold its 98 percent stake in venture capital firm Innolion to a group of investors headed by Gemplus chairman Marc Lassus.</p>
<p>CDR gave no other details of the sale.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
